DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash on NVIDIA GB10 nodes: branch deepseek-v41-zig-tp4 of this fork
Copyright 2026 BertholomusAI (Albert Lee, https://github.com/bertholomus)

This branch adds a DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash family to TensorFold's native engine (1.0.12 since this branch's v0.2.0; 1.0.2
before), under the same Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE), and runs it on two or four GB10 nodes. Its new files are
under zig/src/families/dsv41/, zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41/ (with zig/kernels/cuda/dsv41_ops.cu and dsv41_torch.cu) and
tools/dsv41-zig/, plus zig/src/core/lanes/novelty.zig, zig/src/server/effort_values_test.zig,
zig/src/server/plain_specials_test.zig, zig/src/server/reply_parity.zig, zig/src/server/specials.zig,
zig/src/server/sse_keepalive_test.zig, docs/recipes/deepseek-v41-neighbor.md with its receipts in
docs/receipts/dsv41-neighbor-hardware/ and docs/receipts/dsv41-neighbor-host/, ATTRIBUTION.md and two license texts in
LICENSES/ (PyTorch, CUTLASS) that THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md refers to. tools/dsv41-zig/kit/aot_pack.py is TensorFold
1.0.2's zig/tests/cuda/nemotron/aot_pack.py, kept with a two-line header after 1.0.12 replaced it, because the kits are
packed with it. Seven of the branch's changes are contributions to this fork under the same license, kept under their
authors' names: Lucas Peters (pull request #4), lepetitprince716-prog (pull request #18), Manrique (pull request #26),
Scott Woolsey Biggart (pull request #30), mrsergiopascal (pull request #31) and Blackwellboy (pull requests #33 and
#34); two more port Manrique's pull requests #28 and #29 to the four-node family. ATTRIBUTION.md lists every outside
source the family uses and what it took from each. The branch changes these upstream files:
